  "strings" : {
    "permission.fullAccessStillAsksNoOnce" : {
      "comment" : "Agent pane: a muted line under a permission card's title when the chat runs its highest permission mode and the ask still came to the person (the mode does not answer it, for example because Claude Code marks it as needing the person). {mode} is the harness's native highest-permission mode label, such as 'Bypass permissions' or 'Full access'. Used when the card offers no Allow once.",
